  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urgent MPCA assistance to displaced Gazan workers in Bethlehem and Hebron Governorates</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This intervention entails three main stages/activities; the process of selecting and finalizing the list of the targeted beneficiaries, the cash distribution, and the post monitoring once all activities are accomplished. This intervention is based on the identified crisis of the Gazan workers in the West Bank and how to ensure that all basic needs are provided and the gap is filled.</narrative>
  </description>
